       ves  via  the SCSI tape driver (sstt(4)), and the RAID controller via the
       SCSI  generic  driver  (ssgg(4)),  with  device  nodes  named   _/_d_e_v_/_s_d_*,
       _/_d_e_v_/_s_t_*, and _/_d_e_v_/_s_g_*, respectively.

